window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Magic is different in the Dread Lands. Magic is deceptive in the Dread Lands.</b></p> <p>At last, the Dread Prince takes the throne and begins to develop his own army while battling the darkness that still lurks in the ancient and deadly Dread Lands. Maeve is grieving a great loss as Mal slips into darker and darker Magic, driving a wedge between them. War looms with the other realms, and Maeve and Mal question the dragon-shifting High Lord of Aterna's loyalty to their cause.</p>"; 
